{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:280f16b759b617c893a8f51317ee795f77fe176f343e908549922fb721d82982",
      "text": "能做的事，就是绝不轻言放弃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6fcb1c280391d52390947a01c49d075ff02ba0574b16f90f95cdca8cabc54d",
      "text": "确定出演音乐节目的F-LAGS的三人。\n然而，该节目正面临停播危机，\n现场气氛糟糕透顶。\n于是三人决定通过让所有人展露笑容，\n来引导节目走向成功。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e498f00eddab0e29051b175768d604c18ab0086fada3bff7c892660c85b4f1",
      "text": "第8话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:280f16b759b617c893a8f51317ee795f77fe176f343e908549922fb721d82982",
      "text": "能做的事，就是绝不轻言放弃",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e35381fef96d59385ae1563a2431c49915b8fbb1e6aa400a96ce6d1abd92fd01",
      "text": "某处洋房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d603dc329d92372d4f05b084f55ace71836e9954c4a14946d946f435d75f1f",
      "text": "有人前来商量能否追加JIF的出演者。\n据说是那个投票名额中名列前茅的事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16cab9592dc7a4271f459cc149d1427d2a97806086cef50d104a60af9ca27726",
      "text": "……把资料拿给我看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f98eaa981c630d0ccfb1a26df8f2458dffc67d0dcd988b5592d43adad92a99",
      "text": "糟了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14926d0e06b510bf515122103745ab3254d6da79a86174204f0e25d84f29642e",
      "text": "上啊，武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3135d45417ac312d919378308729eb95602e6bb90bb6fda2bd7f48c9fdecf19",
      "text": "哈啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a00a8e290cc3770241d62e2eb39e5ca33067c998b41977d7f487b31af6aecd",
      "text": "这是前些天举行的活动录像。\n这支组合似乎叫做THE 虎牙道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48438fd7e82ebc85168aa44517f8a95b273005ebcf0978e10f4de86c167c8a6",
      "text": "哎呀，居然狠狠给了雷皇一记重击。这样看来，\n那男人会想支持他们倒也不是不能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16869eafbdd267b9648669a6c979258a77f99def85640765c16c7a74b6731083",
      "text": "（话虽如此……说到底，\n偶像这种存在真的有未来吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfcaa66453474b10f1a5515884f33b570994ff6a7f18bf830181bc5148569fd2",
      "text": "（总觉得无论涌现出什么事务所或偶像，最终\n也不过是落在差不多的规模和销量里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bcbbb002ce78761cd9fda1c1497f78d6f32dfd48ed08b473d441156a5d836ab",
      "text": "（比起这种已经触及天花板的行业，我原本认为应该\n投资更有前景的领域……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de7d56ce8beef2856d6d1b2618211a20462eedeea7352edba451a319be5e5d1",
      "text": "……这家事务所里的偶像组合，\n哪支都行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:461219de3c3d79f1537296abb4d8f97955f42bf901e37f6c6d2709bdd6b13b34",
      "text": "我们不是有出资赞助的音乐节目吗。\n叫他们上那个节目。我要通过节目好好审视一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4b73f1f69477fabfb52cd707febbe2b1a30550e774bc8e808cb585319f46a7d",
      "text": "审视315 Production出演JIF的资格，\n以及“偶像”这门行当。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6413b3e4f200ba01a6ed2464de5fd2a5b3b9a5900fb8343162dc994f00353c3",
      "text": "（……手段真恶劣啊。那个节目最近\n收视率很差，听说现场气氛也糟糕透顶……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdaff02f974b057af59f57ece3b5a6ccdb7e261f2fd86d9aa3a9473775340cac",
      "text": "今天大家嗓子状态都很好呢！\n感觉比上次歌声更有延展性了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c1a6951ed2382bf954ba9f32122cbc8ac9ed8498b86324977c26e664dffac4",
      "text": "真、真的吗！？俺的歌多亏了发声练习，\n也稍微有点偶像的样子了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64952b4b9d5d5b98f45aab977480466d62767ec83eba1b40718595bd1d5478eb",
      "text": "（F-LAGS的各位，进步真是神速！\n照这个状态下去……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f533dd6f0791f46852021faed9ef4da77daedb17c7e329e3b068989226438882",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー！\n现在能耽误一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18ddd3ec13da361b437220ce16e16248d0e1127ce4b713520e661bdd7eddb6fc",
      "text": "贤君，辛苦了。发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062373f0f0911a334dbc1ac7ef04def719bc6d9f93edcdde8dec712d9b4f238b",
      "text": "其实是有一份新工作的邀约！\n具体是这样的内容……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c7ee785502a64a1e3c62514aa4655f06d0f61c6fd83ccdc640a98b2da4db6a8",
      "text": "……原来如此，是音乐节目的出演邀请啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fddc5dfb75961bc17eac66465ec91d89b8daa70f6b875c1e7099ccd8a807f9d8",
      "text": "是的。而且不是普通的音乐节目，而是从我\n小时候起就一直在播的长寿节目呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93096a4ac32fd6fa31cf2a9ea05ba16b2fb67cdd006dc872a3d8f3d731020866",
      "text": "我看看，资料上写着“想向出演的偶像\n多方了解一下前职的经历”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eedc13b994cb96d57dd3b711fc40b389289bd1900bf8dd41559b49ae6d479c8",
      "text": "果然“有前职的偶像”，\n很有话题度呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0a51c376998b6949f8a95a0fe1e5cc0756a28b7f58b045785f7fe697005d3f5",
      "text": "……说起来，之前社长也说过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ced0d4edfb461087030d75324e39304b26f22fd4e85edc674cf3562fc67c0071",
      "text": "正因为315 Production的偶像\n全员都有着形形色色的过去，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab4b70a1f93bce0c2b8aa03f81f22635576b3dee8f8c19bfd85a8de81dfe5f5",
      "text": "才能作为偶像、作为人闪闪发光，\n为大家带来耀眼的光芒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad5f4b39fca46b38b80743916e91d56a68ddacb05abd0ffa8c4eac2e89896b73",
      "text": "这份工作正是向更多人传递偶像们所拥有的\n光芒的好机会呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ed72b5b3a069924ca072e86b0096c9d80e1dc5b94e487cfe94296af1e25b12",
      "text": "（问题在于，该让哪支组合出场呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a686f47c7bd8a9cb0119d1535ecfedc9bcc89fabe8be1878ffd91e002ee4defc",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这份工作，请交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f246cb4dd69150cecf9b39b998780ffd6da2446ccdb7d48588782fd1769ca1",
      "text": "凉君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25754dd6c54442ea6b6b1374aa5e2c1fee7bd53231e7c9033d5b28e96eb3aef5",
      "text": "……我想通过展现自己决不放弃梦想的\n姿态，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d9de41e6323c9fb9f7119000b30b80e4c7e14c66811656450892edbf1f41ef",
      "text": "去推那些正打算放弃梦想的人一把。\n我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0eb9f91b0374e6d7bcf708375123795acf7f9588f612b82f64e70e3d4457f7",
      "text": "我之所以能下定如此坚定的决心，也是因为\n在加入315 Pro之前那段美妙的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f993ff9ce4640775f6d271fdd5ee585447467e97e3658adbdff0eecfc22b1de",
      "text": "正因为有了过去，我们才能发出强烈的光芒。\n我们一定会将那份光芒传递给观众们的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00020fe6ce2f8bafbf9549760d0647fd868508359faa384554ad9d4db3147eaa",
      "text": "……啊，对、对不起！\n我擅自插话了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0feb922b6163d7a33edc998d5109ff2bb3de57a792d7204b4452aa7453e3263",
      "text": "大吾君、一希先生，对不起！没跟你们\n商量就自顾自说了这么果断的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a9a497140b38b5232ee79bc46d3f31066337f4f1fef6340c9e9230f67362c3b",
      "text": "…不，要是凉不说的话，\n我和大吾也会说出一样的话的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abbfd178b611bca7c84d33e99601b8bc2b307cbb6a176cc831c1f40af5d38d9c",
      "text": "是啊，老师说得对。\n刚才的凉，超级热血超级帅气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b99ca8fd2b0cb487f428f02fbd05022429083ae542b357ba1deea1daf2a48c85",
      "text": "凉先生刚才的这番话语和心意，\n隔着电视也一定能够传达到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5934f842725a738131e15611189fe093f9a14280c53a5c6db0a643bf937b97ce",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●老大！\n这么说，愿意交给俺们了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce2849fb06b7f800beb4a86e3b04537fe8895430dbe37b7149f69521856e941",
      "text": "嗯，当然。这次的工作，\n就拜托F-LAGS的各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000153:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc28fc69b2ee84618f6926526597dabf64a0f6c2b0e9b84ef10a635e0ab45a13",
      "text": "Hi，●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53d0c4aa8850a2f2b399f3bcc0363de47a5fe6d95b9144a26c75f8ca8ea9183b",
      "text": "拍摄顺利finish了，所以给你call一个哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99bf0206937d2ca012cfafda00a106e7e4ae8dc51431c3008d6a62156e45cbac",
      "text": "今天的写真拍摄，\n超级exciting超级开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000167:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bc77d41ca23aef09f1f4300180604cf2587b58dcacafbf959d5815bd04da29c",
      "text": "大家摆了各种各样的pose。\n平时不怎么摆的那种pose也有哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000169:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9647ebaea73699a7cb5653acbe8ea4307ae5f131a83466cd288fbd5f9b1739f4",
      "text": "Mr. 硲和Mr. 山下虽然看起来\n都有点紧张……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000171:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4aa8be7118d69cae28b808001b7dc7f7617028d782e914f96f1418989325cd5",
      "text": "不过最后拍出了很cool的照片哦！感觉离大家共同\n瞄准的JIF也更近了一步呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000173:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8037124325938a3fc70fe09629adc5a2b699a29e4ed7ee28548eadf22befd176",
      "text": "数据应该已经送到了，\ncheck就拜托你了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000175:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03dc5db15ee59bc7e41c383c2af37e710847ddd1f0d0ae8f5c0330a42b5abe5c",
      "text": "还有，Mr. 硲说为了下一份工作，\n想听听制作人酱的感想呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4832ddc6fd90910e26c3ac4c41712b41573f0575c1e16f993a6e5dfd1282d62",
      "text": "看了数据后记得联系我哦☆\n那么，see you later！Bye～☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e363cbc725b23eea61bd4fbb6ac3d04aa23f2c5210e4531589fa2c2dc90c676",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。收到了新的工作邀约，\n我们来确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a8bd2c79ba0911d995e5a6c3a95cc556566ea69008a8728d70dec3e45085a83",
      "text": "哎呀，来了不少嘛。……不过，\n不是找彩全员，而是找个人的委托比较多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74962f9fd159fa798a940a938900d36c1a677331567a25ad6938390e1aa3ceac",
      "text": "彩的各位原本就是名人，\n针对个人的邀约确实很多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6aebf3f1b615cd7a3159de97f4f128b24cbca67d7653b873f052fcf785bb7a",
      "text": "抱歉，是我能力不足，\n没能多为大家争取到以组合形式接下的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ae95f3ba55abb64145fd185da61b595ed9ac22e4bf8ba1c67b1a8cd9bb81b4c",
      "text": "这不是●●●●プロデューサー酱的错啦。\n能接到工作就已经很值得感激了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f060f02f8b132bd1bcc9b858275644c709b597613492251e44bd1bc3e4867644",
      "text": "虽说如此，吾辈还是想多跟蝴蝶先生和\n九郎君一起工作喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75993470516a3c31f62ae52de9b66202252df81e8ce0f07cc5e106e4e7286d0b",
      "text": "确实呢……\n其他人的情况又是如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b92f9e1b0b14de20acb7311a89a0ca1460cb7cb66848ddcd0b997f4244f2cdc",
      "text": "前些天F-LAGS的各位，\n确定要出演音乐节目了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2570cb40cc91abc179e76239839f063ca5f46a3bbff32a2980f0967d9a76d461",
      "text": "哎呀，真是可喜可贺！共同切磋琢磨的伙伴能\n接下大工作，真让人高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87fb1ab19602f587f8e03031209dccde7ec9aaeba356fe06b954f4daee8848f8",
      "text": "但是，吾辈们也不能认输喵！\n为了能以彩的身份多上电视，吾辈们也要加油喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4dc9a3f0c019e26fe290c53a9d3ea056dc8de6724ee689cdf5ff80580684037",
      "text": "猫柳先生说得对。\n现在的我们没有时间去烦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec09a8e1be77257567d1de39635092d08d3bcc9e4f6bcd862319343c9e0a232",
      "text": "与伙伴一起，为了实现梦想。\n我们唯有奋勇向前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000149:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d027f183ded82133ddd27110fac9693ff23892879a177233cd5f578b3a17da7",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，辛苦了。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01c973f3eee5bffa5a611fb59ccf6b6ff640ac8820d7e1b8c7993c47be324e56",
      "text": "其实今天有自称是THE 虎牙道粉丝的\n客人，来到我的店里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a30f14a5d8129792fb53191e9f716e486ffea333a0895c981a36d46ac49da3dc",
      "text": "自从开始做偶像之后，\n这类的客人增加了不少呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1cdc97e57d87d7bfb45fe6de8619989582cfbf0587d9b93b0338ef131c361b2",
      "text": "听到粉丝聊起自己的事，\n虽然还不太习惯、怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000167:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e600fd5c99220f3d20ab6c397012bc7ad0dac38e02e3159ed175949b238ced0e",
      "text": "但我也觉得非常高兴！\n深深体会到出道真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000169:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd84e2fddc67869b2f815447c1afacaacd3ca071728383b846631bcabb993e",
      "text": "啊，还有。听店老板说，哪怕我不在店里的时候，\n也会有粉丝专程过来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000171:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f12c8bf57b8bf319046000bc7f4e64edb3b3f458823f58ce02231d3eafb53c14",
      "text": "所以为了在这种时候也能让粉丝开心，\n我正在构思限时供应的新菜单呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000173:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5c31f063a64f97178d46dbe06654344b1fda8aa4c4f1789910b434443a44b1",
      "text": "我也想尝尝看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000175:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8e44859b934f375762a79b9b6b2335af2c1cb362e5c68a28503c266add9808",
      "text": "务必来！等F-LAGS的音乐节目收录\n结束后，大家一起来我的店里吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf5d571548f647f6498a83b41933d3ea33b1c775adae0f6ac13065042a63ecfc",
      "text": "我会请大家吃最棒的\n庆功拉面的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c4edf1094bd468ed253aaf85e8c753706c2126d2b0e442817953bde4d267ec",
      "text": "音乐节目收录当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3631eec7db1ac70e0335d3b85882dae9abd79acdf3a0d44db283670d9ff979f",
      "text": "（终于到了收录当天。……可是，\n现场的各位似乎都有些无精打采）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9eae946edd528cbb1c3a664901667d2d2d50287db82429265be1c5326076eee1",
      "text": "（虽然听说过这个音乐节目面临存续危机的\n传闻，是因为那个缘故吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc85a1fd9988c091c3e0400087e1dcfeb83a51b322139b9732a57fc172457d0",
      "text": "好的，接下来是Live部分的彩排呢。\n我这就去准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:450205ea92ede4ea22cf2d704ab3e0c5efe3e62c6c14b04d650727e3f504b541",
      "text": "……快看，那群靠噱头出位的315 Pro\n好像要开始彩排了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ca6e622b12c62662137cbf9034df5434ba1851f6415a4057f07ad8d429c2ed",
      "text": "哦，你们是同台出演的……\n俺们是F-LAGS，今天请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39aea079eb11608041aca4d76163b302f068ccaf81dfad9b655a6fde0fb2c820",
      "text": "哈哈，同台？别把我们相提并论啊。\n我们可是名正言顺的正经偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c7b2dba97178271ff786c4d528356f94fd567a698899ebb2f7234240f092a7",
      "text": "嗯？“名正言顺”是什么意思啊？\n俺们跟你们一样也是偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346892991734bbb12eb153b220656ee65c6d35104e619f486981a10c637d1b61",
      "text": "反正只要改变主意了就会辞掉偶像吧？\n我们可知道你们根本不是认真的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593fe00b67fae4b03fd63cecd0dfc39e4ffe21d3a9eb07ef9f9fab45e990b18e",
      "text": "喂——！\n大吾君、一希先生，彩排要开始了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75ebccb9d874fda661bee78f1008b036f1ec86157d145771efd5d7cc4181d88",
      "text": "哦，这就来！抱歉啊，\n话说到一半就先失陪了。老师，我们走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7512d263abc57e5411cc932007505735b770d176d5d66060e8674bf7aa5ff2f1",
      "text": "…嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:837387855f6ad61d005a5127fd8683a18579a6b552d15c1494a7fd6863205b61",
      "text": "彩排结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4908d888c9d417e88a370a6ee9f14184dd7c819d03f02e315c37a7249abb050a",
      "text": "嗯……刚才那几个偶像，\n样子感觉有点怪怪的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc598839717afa78b674e57c914d37da1403bc77fda998f7d25f7c0f1c72bff6",
      "text": "你们刚才聊天的那些人？嗯，彩排时\n感觉也挺没精神的呢。不要紧吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2661ddc21d35d45fbd4f911c5cfdef9925e289853035523f7daa33020a18b330",
      "text": "…不只是那几个偶像。\n整体的气氛都沉甸甸的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66bb463c2e419e7648ddb311e31bafe9eb115da69e4ac08ad77dd362dac58ec",
      "text": "…应该是受到了刚才制作人提到的\n节目存续问题的影响吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b38ecde5197f6f3bb0be28c1286eb07c3a28f474570bff9d0dc9eab2e709c06",
      "text": "…说来简单，\n人的情绪这种东西是会传染的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7010f15398efd19183b1cf1ddad4f97c0c6b05e8c2be75642c81be60cfb0ab0f",
      "text": "…特别是“悲伤、痛苦”这种负面情绪，\n比起“幸福”，人们更容易反反复复去回想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303e5e1064b10b4dbbcaaa983097a02d855b6a3c9153d8ec47d6fe4f1493a307",
      "text": "…因此，据说也更容易残留在人的心里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:814704b89419aebec377098d436fe84cbed911ef2fe04772c53c4c1b85bffdcf",
      "text": "那么……只要我们保持快乐的心情，\n这份快乐也会传染给现场吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7e4aee581e0cd0d18882ea1cc3c9291b660a4e4e1e8f56fc0fb1562a96a5def",
      "text": "接下来就是正式演出了，时间紧迫，\n能做的事情也许很有限……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f70313b947ce970726c9804c8ed38276419a83078945b8829fe3f80214a01c",
      "text": "没那回事，凉。光靠正式演出就足够了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2caab213701e44c587c79ebf7304ae9da8195ca54140aaf6f6cff96f78b0f9",
      "text": "俺们原本的打算，就是去唱歌、跳舞、热热闹闹地聊天，\n让镜头另一头的所有人露出笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccf26bd21aa96aa3191deb6cdf6e92815e9651ba58417f98480363346cdfb5d",
      "text": "只是变成了把镜头这边的所有人\n也一并逗笑而已嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9279309c1d083829cdbe6547702fba6e73d11e24804bc832e1b6624b4ecdb17",
      "text": "不过是人数稍微变多了点，完全不用担心！\n所以，笑着走向舞台吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2bf5202f14ed6c3f63affa58c258d2ca1c2a38eb9d9c41d2c923ffbb6b0b69",
      "text": "大吾君……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b58b9541cead08cd941d41d95d40b39ced8250c4baaa7e19635b6c9a7d81e65",
      "text": "呵呵，太有说服力了。\n看到大吾君刚才的笑容，我也涌起自信了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:367831cc87430f9631f7483e6e0c5fae6df18c052075ef0d4ff1cca34f8c88fc",
      "text": "节目正式开演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a244b69893cb8d83a1c54ac5fad057ba946d77f0aa15f638f401cb0f4466e33",
      "text": "接下来登场的，是最近引发热议的315 Production！\n据说他们拥有很多经历独特的偶像哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60c49d87e585ee0e5e512657cb10cfe4c070f0887e90fcc8fd92439b0b1ea7b5",
      "text": "顺便问一下，F-LAGS的各位\n都有着怎样的经历呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f011055a4891ea249ffaf6951c93afa924da627b96762db66712ee446c1b6c3f",
      "text": "可能有些人已经知道了，\n我以前做过女性偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05540dbc23f35e2b8db0bd864890b2ec62944652581ddbecc92154732738e9d4",
      "text": "俺跟偶像完全不沾边，\n原本是在家里帮忙做家业的。然后老师是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40781e46c6682f54c1b82037fdcf2b8d62684a644a32f2def295c0283b8a624",
      "text": "…我是小说家。虽然现在已经不写了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92bfa2a67e7a5d167422623192d0bc46394a723c0b19f2257ed9e66fb42a805a",
      "text": "小说家转行当偶像！那可真少见！\n难怪最近大众都对各位如此关注呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637beff5e9fefd689cb6e529ecdb836436adb745d1442365863d7c5811220d8b",
      "text": "是的。我们的经历各不相同。也正因如此，\n才有唯独我们才能做到的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c76baa53394414be4c2e343307498192de7fad66e61292ee8463c69974fff7",
      "text": "在接下来的舞台上，我们想展现出这一点。\n请大家多多关注哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7b1efa139153e58c6a6963241a353a72d3bb3819d82cd9a19b39667230fbfe",
      "text": "非常感谢。那么事不宜迟，\n就请F-LAGS的三位带来演唱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b317b217c602e585ad52bc334a819e3770dacfad46958b8448638b10a0bbfa",
      "text": "（要是跟其他偶像比起来，\n俺的歌声和舞蹈肯定还差得远。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0287c519226384d3c9c8c38096f9432dba49c9315783669f106381b4149f58be",
      "text": "（俺非常清楚笑容的重要性。\n正因如此，俺才拥有能够鼓舞凉的笑容）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d073627e371d8d7fdc99595f5a9952081097da6ebecf7db6610fdb379bb83872",
      "text": "（伙伴夸奖过的笑容。\n这就是俺最强的武器！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15479d0e0ab83ef9e79d3894a782b877592f4a786ea1038778e96d9ea49e1f1d",
      "text": "（那天，我坦白自己其实是男孩子的地方，\n也是在音乐节目上）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e2fd3fdfde1a9a4824924548e9a0f90120461db784a38a7e785a00e4c38067",
      "text": "（坦白之后，遭到了封杀，\n被各种各样的人责备……即便如此）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000220:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42bc138e299dc07c99e14420b9e02abfb8e1728ba929dccb7848021e67e968f9",
      "text": "（为了想成为男性偶像的梦想，\n我绝不退缩，一路走到了这里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000227:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bbea24f9040a91357c96e985dee0375860b5b5e24ae9ff1803f201ab15349d4",
      "text": "（在今天的舞台上，我要把不断向前的身影\n传递出去！传递给那些正打算放弃梦想的人！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000246:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67739b4a2e9f63a9658242edb6164ea1f22dc8dc542d1f75385076bb9bce1656",
      "text": "（…偶像九十九一希能够带去笑容的人数，\n或许还很少。但是…）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3e1d5709b9b57ffef88b1e16c63992f30994356876f30729e8b187e46d709c2",
      "text": "（…我不是父亲的替身，也不是任何人的替身。\n我想用我自己的力量，去带给人们快乐）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_g:cmd-000257:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d50ba99ad38ee3b4c88392f2b1193aebd1e616269c3fe031f079e653d660bb",
      "text": "（…唯有这份心情，我想要毫不虚假地传递出去！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d1fe2907e88919185da4933cde648ceea8cbad274cf4eb791ce760c2da52fc",
      "text": "就在同一时间……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa04d3b34b92f803185707456784709e5d148f106573f5aeeb202734a22abdb6",
      "text": "今天也辛苦了喵！肚子也饿了，\n接下来去吃个大餐怎么样喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aedc88cbdef6e8475fef0348ab9790ba9c4981273c7418a085c76062f53889e",
      "text": "大家一起去庆功吗。\n挺好的呢♪……哎呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccabdd83e980d451726c720c0467e28746e886ad562abf7ee63a41fa5f772d8f",
      "text": "好久不见，翔真！我听到传闻了哦。\n听说你组了一个叫彩的偶像组合？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43144d3067d83275344650c58d867aeecde5701c8eabe742de4fbecad0a4850c",
      "text": "下次我们看看能不能一起合作工作。\n到时就拜托啦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cce62ae099c8bfc0ac77b58ce48bde14d829a00ad487b278fb77be4ed8568239",
      "text": "（那个人，我记得是食品行业的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e833baeba7344f598a6a84f799b789ae612d4db78fef5eac7f6e0d555520715d",
      "text": "华村先生，刚才那位是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9577ff2e80430c171afc28c6d150e957fa8fef32f89ca8494723e323f3b1a150",
      "text": "唔唔。总觉得吾辈们要有好事发生了喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78d7244793ff288cf0f0aa425dd883419ccded465aac61cd6052004c7d5022b9",
      "text": "呵呵，只是熟人啦。不过，说得也是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c38c03cfe49db411ef9a667257f83612f91433311b5d6f4bf50cd19026494d",
      "text": "说不定真如小哥预感的那样，\n我们也要迎来好机会了呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf61ac67ad424fbd2f4344db28e7e644b65dd2bc015fadff4ce324d4ba8c33c2",
      "text": "那莫非是……能让彩更加活跃、\n让茶道人口进一步增加的好事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1d7e0fef5af0078ecd9221bdfc22c5659d945870099f71915140e04b9cac77",
      "text": "哎呀讨厌，干劲的开关被按下了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346c73b32912daaf07c055f4a53c9c47a0cb699a33a817ac82cd7510dbd900be",
      "text": "两位，庆功取消了。为了无论何种机会\n到来都能接得住，我们这就回去做准备吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955ba38914710e96a95ebe07aaada016953a8d07f32089594358e1f7a0ff5b30",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了。\n展现出了超越练习水平的绝佳表演哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aefddba1b5685e5b7a19bd334883c9d64178d64d079453b942e51857fb5783a5",
      "text": "…刚才的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82ee4153abfa78d94b0957a04825a811a7bfb074ba26c86c4af21d4a13d7e174",
      "text": "……刚才的舞台，我们看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27743bec9e90aed4d946ccb2c96d1da8382f6621c88e685ab170fe12502d7986",
      "text": "F-LAGS和我们一样，\n是名副其实的正经偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb5faf93eb781d09a1d4a896aabec252d3f1c7e4cdb00b5fd42fd1221faf25a",
      "text": "……嘛，毕竟是有那个秋月凉在的组合嘛。\n我们本来也没觉得你们低人一等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83a4d74cedd249fa97735171de30eec11a64f9230395eaf9278e920f34d67f3",
      "text": "只是受了现场紧绷气氛的影响吧……\n做出那种不像竞争对手该有的难看行径，对不住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a",
      "text": "诶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98d02428a43ac9e85af9fb54ece557b61bdbb451accc3d2d59d7791112456c5",
      "text": "竞、竞争对手！？\n能被男孩子认作对手，太让我感动了～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f2b239411c11d19bb1fcc94757890e2d553883299fea6adb6e284a259895bc",
      "text": "哇哈哈。俺们才刚出道嘛。俺也和凉\n一样，竞争对手增加了很开心！对吧老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5151c066253b7bf671425d03079f3e5544ee37c993dc636a470a0d3731e3cee1",
      "text": "…嗯。我们也要向你们的舞台表演\n学习。学习何谓偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8297ea9c6f65b04bd2b191e79b38226793b3ba9e075cddf14a10efb35decffc3",
      "text": "哈哈……我们也是！\n期待下次有机会同台合作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b080810f1ff45d5558062dd38b0c26f7a7a011d37ac41324b53d31c3bddc7356",
      "text": "现场各位的气氛，\n一下子变得明朗起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f156211eb0e4853ba90b5e7e1e99780c5771ddf690269338a1ae7959b910f044",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，我的心情也变得更加明朗了！\n果然，久违地上音乐节目还是有点紧张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df1645bdd120b36447395d84f38a0f52a331cf04b9a062cfe685ccd02bfb752a",
      "text": "…想必是这样吧。即便如此，\n我们的舞台也确实带给了人们笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c99d6141c19960e2b061e92e78f54fdc72fe5bd89afb5574674577883614764",
      "text": "…镜头这边的所有人都在微笑着。\n这份心意，一定会传染给观众的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000198:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af47d1abd431bf1cb7db1780b41b6a9f37df414a787e589ebb1aff18cda3f2c",
      "text": "节目播完了呢！\n不知道粉丝们看得很开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9f71192ed445fa0a409209dfcfff9984b7f1d3b8d44e6f2de9bd4efbfbcdd51",
      "text": "大家肯定都展露笑容了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da2ddb889d0a3eacdc9be93c690c0a4a1581f5188f9478f759e4912dc90ec36",
      "text": "不过，俺的紧张\n隔着电视都传过来了呢…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16385405a316f59e42f8234ea1bfcf74addf869c73aa745d90ff9b5e558cb9fd",
      "text": "我也差不多。\n谈话环节的时候，紧张尤其全写在脸上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2233359c174f59222067dab34f2b6fcacda10996f27ae6f90bdad859d34bc835",
      "text": "在这一点上，我觉得凉跟平时没什么两样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935fadf0c6d8f41d8b35364a6d5cbf05513543d978a2b3be58b3f9ce5c7c2e11",
      "text": "哦，俺也这么觉得！\n那就是习惯和经验上的差距了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbc204511b16368e272b7dc4052db27eee856998a4e12b032169bd21f88708bb",
      "text": "真的吗？\n明明长着一张一眼就能看出超级紧张的脸来着<emoji>image_talk_emoji_14</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000219:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb0e96d732369bf51734fc6913af702bf97dfd452220063f3769cdc1a594437a",
      "text": "不过，大家一唱起歌来\n紧张感就烟消云散了呢。\n看起来非常开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000221:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aa766bdfbd643b081c51dc00148a410d535a8d97a0133295082682c585e4ed1",
      "text": "播放量在增长哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000221:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da82106c5ddde173605bb0fe6f4ce7aca6061eae4a39c163a3ada802e7c705ec",
      "text": "播出后，大家上传到315 Pro官方\n频道的视频播放量在持续上涨哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de1d886b96975510f82f94e8c3f61f5395a938ce52eda41521d0a8f5f624359",
      "text": "真高兴啊！也就是说对俺们\n感兴趣的人变多了吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfe8304a8c7d48968c8dd9a523738a8b0449af503cb13efa38afe27381b08b1",
      "text": "既然受到了更多关注，\n我们就重新打起精神来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000228:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eec33f23974c79d59d612872e7fff686820a18004cabb26c9ccfb01c9b89111b",
      "text": "好的！为了能让更多的人\n展露笑容，从明天开始也继续加油吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e46c155a2882378a8c67033bf607144bd8edd3b8b2bf099543e106e31db3ac0f",
      "text": "那档音乐节目收到了很多反响。\n那个，不仅是来自观众……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c886901f3cf05173de96c22c3b5b067e39f188d1338de003bf7145a94a5616",
      "text": "工作人员也表示这家事务所和偶像非常令人感激。\n这是当天的节目画面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b75f85a245d1682d93ff2e451fcc976c3f8a4637e2275d9ad039322c270cf83",
      "text": "电视机前的各位，\n听俺们的歌听得还开心吗——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3c56537fa53414cb99811277a69ade4712273eb204931ee6e2e9fa6b637e68",
      "text": "…我们今后也不会吝啬任何努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65289a6d4e7c045323605f14024961a45b7a95ab8e3fa4e796b2f7e6e9bb9fb1",
      "text": "所以，还请多多支持我们！\n以上就是F-LAGS！下次再见喽——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ac4975f87d902df4ac05f14c9b2ee83de2e80e2e0f7a2c1c9cc224700a12e9",
      "text": "就算拿录像给我看，我这个只是出钱当赞助商的老太婆\n也看不出跟其他偶像有什么区别。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1aaa45d87285fa238cb06ad2551ebe3b08aa93aff237eb3c44a71cb69c277e",
      "text": "不过，单看这观众人数和咨询量，\n看来是我的眼光出了差错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2e9e2f97a26b9084453c49a488c66991c64d2359480e2ccfecfb9dd5accbf5",
      "text": "行吧，对这档音乐节目的投资就按继续推进处理。\n还有，关于315 Pro出演JIF的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e811039032029cdd74dd4fe074da803c9ab62889bdbf26e312ff8473b35aef9b",
      "text": "我觉得挺好的。\n就直接按内定去推进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
